{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/910249-a-pie-in-the-sky-desire","id":910249,"title":"A Pie In The Sky Desire","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-08T12:33:24-07:00","id":910249,"title":"A Pie In The Sky Desire","content":"One thing I've noticed is that sometimes different gamelines have... differing... rules for certain systems, like dream rules, that are mutually inconsistent (like, do you carry over damage you take in dreams to the waking world, or do you take the Soul Shocked condition instead?). Even worse, I have, like, four damn copies of the ephemeral being rules! That's a waste of wordcount, right there - more space that could be allotted to cool new stuff for cool people.<br /> <br /> What I'd love to see happen is for OPP to pay a freelancer X number of dollars to write up a short PDF with the rules for stuff that aren't <i>universal</i>, but which are <i>shared</i>. A one-stop shop for your ephemeral beings, or your dream rules.<br /> <br /> Then just bundle it in with your purchase of the relevant books for free - and maybe make it available to purchase as a bundle of all of them for people who just want them. Heck, it's reasonably trivial to insert a pdf into another pdf... so you could just use them for that.<br /> <br /> I know this is never going to happen. But it'd be nice.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avata